/-!
# Natural rank-one coordinates and recognition of the block type

The actual offender action satisfies the universal classifier's hypotheses.
Its exhaustive rank-one alternatives, together with the exact earlier
13.6.15 seed exclusion, construct natural coordinates on U_K/C_U_K(K) over
the original field. This construction is independent of any block witness.

The relative block disjunction is then resolved by the actual A₅-module
exclusion and the literal block-section comparison, preserving the exponent.
Source.naturalSection and Source.isL2EvenBlock are the assembly endpoints;
their universal classification and earlier-source premises remain explicit.

Source: Aschbacher–Smith, combined 1 March 2004 manuscript, pp.930–931.
-/
